config BR2_PACKAGE_HELIX_AAC
	bool "helix-aac"
	help
	  RealNetworks' fixed-point HE-AAC decoder, built from the copy
	  vendored in the ESP8266Audio library. Linked by Raptor's RTSP
	  daemon to decode AAC on the ONVIF backchannel.

	  Static library, staging only: nothing is installed into the
	  rootfs.

	  https://github.com/earlephilhower/ESP8266Audio
